    <selectionEntry id="f8e9-87f7-bff2-64fc" name="Manos the Mad" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="7549-85db-3399-9b81" name="The Flames of Blood" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">Template</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Assault 1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2" />
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="fd64-946d-ea2a-9439" name="The Eye of Judgement" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">12"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Assault 1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">Special</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="4500-3d7a-73aa-8fc3" name="Brazier of Damnation" hidden="false">
          <description>Manos has a 5+ cover save at all times, allowing him to strike first as if in cover. If Manos joins a Cult unit, each member of the unit gains +1 I and +1 A in the first round of an Assault.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="9e04-4186-c632-c14f" name="The Eye of Judgement" hidden="false">
          <description>The Eye of Judgement targets the closest enemy model in any direction, and fires even if Manos used his flamer. It cannot target models that do not have Ld score, so if that is the closest it will target the bext closest. The Eye of Judgement hits automatically, but the target must pass a Leadership test, or they take a Strength 5 hit with no saves allowed.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="166f-ff09-05aa-9c69" name="Crown of Iron" hidden="false">
          <description>Manos cannot be wounded by ranged weappons with a Strength lower than his Toughness. He can still be wounded as normal by Sniper Rifles or other weapons that wound without comparing Strength &amp; Toughness.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="0627-67b2-ff47-dc84" name="Manos the Mad" hidden="false" targetId="1dc6-d538-c363-2008" type="profile" />
        <infoLink id="8565-4c3b-84db-6527" name="Close Combat Weapon" hidden="false" targetId="46d5-85f2-d932-f0a2" type="profile" />
      </infoLinks>
      <costs>
        <cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="60" />
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="51ef-a65a-726b-34b1" name="Janos Armistadt" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <rules>
        <rule id="fac0-e20d-a45e-806c" name="He Who Runs Away..." hidden="false">
          <description>The Magus can make a Voluntary Fall-back by making a successful Leadership Test, leaving his Bodyguard to keep on fighting in an Assault. He will automatically Regroup after this movement has ended, or if he reaches the edge of the board. Janos may also choose to flee the table altogether. If he does so, he will not count for Victory Points, but he does count for being dead for other Cult special rules.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="89ab-c926-340d-8146" name="Refractor Field" hidden="false">
          <description>Gain a 5+ invulnerable save</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="4f23-dff4-f6ef-158a" name="Test of Wills" hidden="false">
          <description>Use this power at the start of the Cult player's assault phase against a single enemy model within 6" within LOS. If the psychic test is passed, both Janos and the target model roll 2D6 and add their Leadership. If Janos's total is higher, he can then make a normal Assault mode with the model. The Assault Phase is then conducted as normal, but the target model counts as being in the Cult Army for the rest of the phase.

The power will only work on living creatures, so Vehicles, Daemons, Necrons, Thousand Sons, Avatars, Wraithguard, etc. cannot be effected. Tyranids of any type are not effected by the power either.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="d971-389c-6ef1-0131" name="The Shephard's Staff" hidden="false">
          <description>The Staff counts as a Power Weapon, but requires two hands to use so no other combat bonuses for extra attacks can be used. The Staff also counts a Sacred Item.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="bfb4-0465-9b9b-f690" name="The Serpent's Tooth" hidden="false">
          <description>Grants Rending Claws ability to Janos</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="d51e-78aa-22e4-6875" name="Independent Character" hidden="false" targetId="4a60-7f7e-c37f-a4d6" type="rule" />
        <infoLink id="6594-22f9-ca60-d4e6" name="Janos Armistadt" hidden="false" targetId="4249-ef3f-e13e-fa90" type="profile" />
        <infoLink id="81d4-c3bb-1dd6-b107" name="Bolt Pistol" hidden="false" targetId="e9ac-c779-51bb-3c9a" type="profile">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="name" value="Master Crafted Bolt Pistol" />
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
        <infoLink id="1b37-dec5-2a67-72cc" name="Hypnotic Gaze" hidden="false" targetId="7480-6633-9906-f11b" type="rule" />
      </infoLinks>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="c9dc-1b5a-2383-f7df" name="Bodyguard" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="070a-80f3-4981-7d11" type="max" />
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry id="9636-c6ec-d5aa-ed36" name="Protectorate Bodyguard" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <rules>
                <rule id="807c-ca63-e1a2-032e" name="We Fall So That He May Live" hidden="false">
                  <description>Bodyguards will never Fall Back for any reason. When the unit is hit by ranged fire, the Cult player may apply up to 3 hits per Bodyguard Initiate before having to allocate any hits on the Magus. In an assault, after all models have moved the Cult player may swap the Magus with another Bodyguard Initiate model. The same thing can be done when the unit is hit by any template or area effect weapons.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry id="b9be-ce0e-7faa-c5b9" name="Cult Relic" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade" sortIndex="3">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="d1ff-aad3-fba0-deeb" type="max" />
                  </constraints>
                  <infoLinks>
                    <infoLink id="c157-36d1-cde0-6d64" name="Cult Relic" hidden="false" targetId="c8e6-e2a6-e887-5a21" type="rule" />
                  </infoLinks>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="16" />
                  </costs>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
              <selectionEntryGroups>
                <selectionEntryGroup id="f1f1-043c-5632-aa71" name="Protectorates" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="81af-7b73-224e-460a" sortIndex="1">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="10" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="7dfb-c13e-5cde-d91d" type="max" />
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="5859-3c7c-6191-20f2" type="min" />
                  </constraints>
                  <selectionEntries>
                    <selectionEntry id="81af-7b73-224e-460a" name="Protectorate" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="model">
                      <rules>
                        <rule id="94d0-875e-227b-aec7" name="Suicide Bombers" hidden="false">
                          <description>At the start of either player's Assault Phase each Protectorate model may detonate their bomb, instantly killing themselves but causing one model in contact to take an automatic Strength 6 hit. Only models in base contact are effected, and any casualties count toward resolving the Assault. Once all Suicide Bombs are completed, resolve the rest of the Assault Phase as normal.

This special attack can also be used against vehicles as well, with each model causing an automatic hit with an AP value of 6+D6, no matter the vehicle type or speed.</description>
                        </rule>
                        <rule id="e8dd-6885-7b71-b9fe" name="Death or Glory Attack" hidden="false">
                          <description>When Tank Shocked, multiple Protectorate members can stand and detonate their bomb. The cult player must declare how many Protectorate will be standing and remove them from play, and then resolve that many attacks against the vehicle.</description>
                        </rule>
                      </rules>
                      <infoLinks>
                        <infoLink id="649e-93ca-2690-7daa" name="Protectorate" hidden="false" targetId="975f-c2b7-0b45-d50c" type="profile" />
                        <infoLink id="6443-c412-e2a8-5746" name="Close Combat Weapon" hidden="false" targetId="46d5-85f2-d932-f0a2" type="profile" />
                      </infoLinks>
                      <costs>
                        <cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="9" />
                      </costs>
                    </selectionEntry>
                  </selectionEntries>
                </selectionEntryGroup>
                <selectionEntryGroup id="2071-7f89-cd1f-2bc8" name="Weapon Options" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" sortIndex="4">
