          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Friendly units with the Genestealer Cults Faction within 12" of this model have the Feel No Pain (6+) special rule. Models that already have the Feel No Pain (excluding Acolyte Iconwards) special rule instead add 1 to their Feel No Pain rolls.</description>
