    <selectionEntry id="3b71-90a5-5ca2-2abc-9889a" name="The Crouchling" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="d963-9cf6-4240-9198-9889a" name="The Crouchling" page="101" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In close combat, a model with accompanied by the Crouchling makes two additional S4 AP- attacks with the Rending special rule. In addition, the bearer may generate one additional psychic power at the start of the game.  The Crouchling is represented by a separate miniature that will always remain as close as possible to it's master. The model itself is decorative and is always ignored for game purproses - just move it to one side if it gets in the way. Remove the Crouchling once it's master has been slain.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="3b71-90a5-5ca2-2abc-maxSelections-9889a" type="max" />
        <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" id="3b71-90a5-5ca2-2abc-maxInRoster-9889a" type="max" />
      </constraints>
      <selectionEntries />
      <selectionEntryGroups />
      <entryLinks />
      <costs>
        <cost name="Points" value="20.0" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" />
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="57f9-ea29-4fc2-ee67-9889a" name="The Doting Throng" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="ff8d-b084-2313-f764-9889a" name="Frenzied Devotion" page="92" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Units from this Formation have the Zealot special rule whilst they are within 12" of a friendly Magus. Furthermore, a unit that is actually joined by a Magus can re-roll failed To Hit rolls in every round of close combat, not just the first.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="eb99-5454-7931-3950-9889a" name="Willing Subjects" page="92" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>If a Magus targets a Neophyte Hybrid or Acolyte Hybrid unit from this Formation with a blessing psychic power, be can re-roll the Psychic test if it is failed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints />
      <selectionEntries />
      <selectionEntryGroups>
