          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry id="20f8-3c49-8ec8-fde7" name="Patriach Ichor Vial" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="3b23-75f4-5e28-6894" type="max" />
            <constraint field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="2b79-2497-8b58-d73a" type="max" />
          </constraints>
          <rules>
            <rule id="82cf-57ef-6ad4-59f4" name="Patriach Ichor Vial" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per battle at any time in the Assault Phase the bearer my shatter the vial. All Cult members belonging to any units with at least one model or open-topped vehicles within 2D6" of the bearer are filled with fanatical zeal. Roll once on the table below to see what effect occurs. This effect wears off at the end of the current turn.
1: +1 I
2: +1 A
3: +1 S
4: +1 WS
5: Re-roll Misses
6: Re-roll failed wounds and vehicle armour pen</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <costs>
            <cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="40" />
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry id="83e0-ec89-022c-bb9b" name="Scanner" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="1bf3-367b-b566-54b6" type="notInstanceOf" />
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="c406-23d3-1c02-6e7f" type="notInstanceOf" />
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="0423-229b-6b80-450e" type="max" />
          </constraints>
          <rules>
            <rule id="616e-3aed-9a92-45f2" name="Scanner" hidden="false">
              <description>If enemy infiltrators set up with 4D6" of a model with a surveyor then the model is allowed to take a 'free' shot at them. If the model is part of a unit, the whole unit may shoot. These shots are taken before the battle begins and may cause the infiltrators to fall back.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <costs>
            <cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="5" />
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry id="8690-1a4b-dc93-eeb8" name="Targeter" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="1bf3-367b-b566-54b6" type="notInstanceOf" />
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="c406-23d3-1c02-6e7f" type="notInstanceOf" />
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="ad5d-430e-3cbd-f53e" type="max" />
          </constraints>
          <rules>
            <rule id="54ac-d3b8-8d0f-2186" name="Targeter" hidden="false">
              <description>Models equipped with a targeter are allowed to pre-measure the range to a target before they decide who to shoot at in the Shooting phase. This ability must be used after all Guess ranged weapons have been used this turn, otherwise those weapons cannot fire this turn.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <costs>
            <cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="7" />
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry id="d77a-f2eb-b673-8379" name="Cult Relic" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="1bf3-367b-b566-54b6" type="notInstanceOf" />
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="c406-23d3-1c02-6e7f" type="notInstanceOf" />
